      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When the weight feels this crushing, it's completely understandable that the thought of stopping feels like the only promise of peace. However, please know that even when things feel permanent, the intensity of these feelings can change with support. If those overwhelming thoughts are strong, please contact the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline right now; they are trained to help navigate these intense feelings. You deserve peace, and there are people who want to help you find it while you are here.",
